; NO `until`: the AURA owns this buff's lifetime - PassiveAura.update_unit strips it the moment the
; aura stops being active or the unit leaves range (passive_aura.gd:55-59). A lifetime here would be a
; second, competing clock.
;
; HIDDEN, and flagged J for the author (ruling 13 leaves it "on sight"): the Leoleth's own chip is the
; signal, and the Mark's soft cover is this mod's precedent for plumbing beside a visible chip. It is
; STILL drawn in the roll breakdown - attack_roll.gd:189 passes buff_core.base.icon RAW - which is why
; it is listed in HIDDEN_BUFFS_NEEDING_ICONS. SP5: reuses buff_rage_bulwark's own tint - one mechanic,
; one picture, whichever side of it is asking.
icon = ExtResource("2_icon")
